OL,3,GNEWSANew French route cuts oyster
OL,4,Afirm's export costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn oyster firm expects to save tens of
OL,7,Fthousands of pounds after a new export
OL,8,Fservice opened in France.
OL,10,FThe veterinary inspection service
OL,11,Fopened in Granville on 21 October,
OL,12,Fwhich officials said marked "an
OL,13,Fimportant step forward" for the
OL,14,Faquaculture industry.
OL,16,FChris Le Masurier, who runs Jersey
OL,17,FOyster Company, said it was the first
OL,18,Ftime the Granville facility had been
OL,19,Foperating since 2020 because of
OL,20,Fpost-Brexit changes requiring products
OL,21,Fof animal origin to go through a border
OL,22,Fcontrol post in St Malo.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
