OL,3,GNEWSANew French route cuts oyster
OL,4,Afirm's export costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the requirement to use St Malo
OL,7,Ffor oyster exports from Jersey "was
OL,8,Fbasically costing #100,000 a year
OL,9,Fextra" due to the longer distance.
